          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Qwen4-Max by @Alibaba_Qwen is the #1 Chinese model on the leaderboard making Alibaba now the #1 Chinese lab and #5 lab overall, just behind Anthropic, Google, OpenAI and Meta.",
